# Bug hunt round 1 (trains): on a moving train he walks from the first coach to the second and back again.
stream on
train at station
stand in coach 1
tick 30
walk to coach 2 12
expect walk.there == 1
expect walk.lowest > 0.6
walk to coach 1 12
print player
expect walk.there == 1
expect walk.lowest > 0.6
expect aboard == 1
